  "interpretation": "The default SSP AMOC response is dominated by a FAFMIP-informed empirical global-forcing-index sinking-capacity proxy and is not a process-derived or independently validated forecast. FovS is diagnosed from prognostic AMOC and conservative salinity states, so it is not prescribed, but its trajectory is conditional on that empirical AMOC response while the forced-heat capacity controls."
